#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:5
msgid "Conductor properties"
msgstr "导体属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:7
msgid ""
"Some `conductor properties`_ can be common at all or large proportion of "
"`conductors`_ from all or large proportion of `folios`_. For example, the "
"`conductor type`_ is normally common for a complete `project`_ or for a "
"group of `folios`_."
msgstr ""
"某些 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ 可能适用于全部或大部分 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中的全部或大部分 `导体 "
"<conductors_>`_ 。例如， `导体类型 <conductor type_>`_ 通常对一整个 `项目 <project_>`_ 或一组 "
"`图幅 <folios_>`_ 都是通用的。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:10
msgid ""
"To increase the working efficiency, QElectroTech provides the option to "
"storage at the project Data some `project properties`_ pre-defined by the "
"user. This feature allows the user avoiding to define many `conductor "
"properties`_ each time that the user `creates new conductor`_ inside the "
"`project`_."
msgstr ""
"为了提高工作效率，QElectroTech 提供了将用户预定义的一些 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ "
"存储到项目数据中的选项。此功能让用户在 `项目 <project_>`_ 中每次 `创建新导体 <creates new conductor_>`_ "
"时，无需重复定义大量 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:16
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining automatically `conductor properties`_ during "
"`project creation`_. For more information about how to standardize some "
"`conductor properties`_ from `project`_ to `project`_, please refers to the "
"`QElectroTech conductor settings`_ section."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在 `项目创建 <project creation_>`_ 期间自动定义 `导体属性 <conductor "
"properties_>`_ 。有关如何让某些 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ 从一个 `项目 <project_>`_"
" 到另一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 保持统一的更多信息，请参阅 `QElectroTech 导体设置 <QElectroTech "
"conductor settings_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:20
msgid ""
"The **Conductor** tab from **New folio** settings section allows pre-"
"defining some `conductor properties`_:"
msgstr "**新建图幅** 设置部分中的 **导体** 标签页允许预先定义一些 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ ："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:22
msgid "`Conductor type`_ (`Multiline`_ or `Single line`_)."
msgstr ""
"`导体类型 <Conductor type_>`_ （ `多线 <Multiline_>`_ 或 `单线 <Single line_>`_ ）。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:23
msgid "`Conductor appearance`_."
msgstr "`导体外观 <Conductor appearance_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:28
msgid "Figure: Project conductor properties window"
msgstr "图：项目导体属性窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:30
msgid "To define conductor settings:"
msgstr "要定义导体设置："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:32
msgid "`Display`_ project properties PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:33
msgid "Go to **New folio** section."
msgstr "转到 **新建图幅** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:34
msgid "Go to **Conductor** tab."
msgstr "转到 **导体** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:35
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "为每个字段设置所需的参数。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:36
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close project "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改并关闭项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/conductor.rst:40
msgid ""
"All pre-defined `conductor properties`_ at `project properties`_ will be "
"automatically defined during `folio creation`_ at `folio properties`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 中预定义的所有 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ ，都会在"
" `图幅创建 <folio creation_>`_ 时自动填入 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ 。"
